{"availability":"available","full":"edulazaro/larasearch","name":"larasearch","description":"Text search for Eloquent on your own database: list searches and a global index for command palettes","category":"Developer tools","language":"PHP","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-02T23:41:42Z","updated":"2026-10-03T13:00:51Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":null,"color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Text search for Eloquent models on your own database. No Elasticsearch, no Meilisearch, no service to run. Two uses, one trait:","Every word of the term must appear, in any order and in any field. Text is stored and searched the same way: lower case, without accents, with single spaces, so \"camion\" finds \"Camión\". LIKE wildcards are escaped, so \"50%\" means fifty per cent. On MySQL whole words go through a FULLTEXT index."],"features":["Lists. Each model keeps a normalized searchtext column built from the fields you name, and searchText($term) filters on it inside any query, next to your own scopes, filters and pagination.","A global index, for command palettes and site-wide search. Models that say how to show themselves keep a row in one searchables table, scoped by tenant and filtered, at search time, by what each user may see."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/edulazaro/larasearch/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f3208c193e92b5937567fea06e092293af76e30f94636d8016a77ec25a766ed8","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Text search for Eloquent models on your own database. No Elasticsearch, no Meilisearch, no service to run. Two uses, one trait:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/edulazaro/larasearch/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"optional","text":"The column is written when the model is saved, in the same write, and only when one of the fields changed: saving a project whose status alone changed costs nothing extra.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/edulazaro/larasearch/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"f3208c193e92b5937567fea06e092293af76e30f94636d8016a77ec25a766ed8","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/edulazaro/larasearch/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-03T13:00:51Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/edulazaro/larasearch/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z","hash":"f3208c193e92b5937567fea06e092293af76e30f94636d8016a77ec25a766ed8","originalBytes":9232,"storedBytes":9232,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["model","user","php","project","index","larasearch","search","models","name","like","static","table","text","rows","searchable","column","fields","finds","function","mysql","one","protected","public","searchablefor","when","words","builder","every","fulltext","own","query","return","row","searchtext","task","term","anywhere","app","artisan","bash","edulazaro","event","global","hassearch","how","record","result-","sees","string","tenant","through","visibleto","whose","without","word","acme","any","array","changed","client","company","composer","each","keeps","lists","nothing","only","palette","reindex","results","route","same","searchables","searching","them","what","add","alone","built","changes","children","class","command","date","does","eloquent","else","email","extends","fails","filters","find","forza","found","holds","horizon","index.","instead","keep","keeping","leaves","license","made","migration","nbsp","never","numbers","once","organization","override","owner","paginate","palettes